6424881 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "ef55c585-a616-50c9-9382-ffb7b5a8ceda" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424882 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{1}{27}{x}^{3}-\\frac{5}{9}{x}^{2}+\\frac{8}{9}x+\\frac{1}{3}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424882 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424882 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "fbbc1dbf-3cbe-5835-99b1-f9050b0ed224" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424883 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186424869 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424883 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186424875 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424883 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186424877 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424883 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186424878 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424883 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186424882 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424883 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424883 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424883 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186424875 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424883 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "5340e926-2580-5f2f-bf08-46d25e342346" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424884 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186424871 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424884 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186424872 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424884 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186424873 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424884 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186424880 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424884 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186424881 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424884 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424884 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424884 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186424881 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424884 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "ce55fccd-c2b9-544b-881d-b59a7e7c0f42" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424885 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186424868 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424885 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186424870 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424885 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186424874 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424885 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186424876 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424885 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186424879 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424885 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424885 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424885 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186424870 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424885 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "cf2e7998-6dc3-5838-ae14-0d427c2b4449" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424886 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186424884 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424886 #edb/ref 1069 "q-89727" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424886 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424886 #edb/ref 1071 "Given that the random variable $X$ has the probability density function\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\frac{{e}^{-|x/3|}}{6},\\,x\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ),\n$$\n\nits cumulative distribution function is \n\n$$\nF(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{e}^{x/3}}{2},\\, & x<0 \\\\ h(x),\\, & x\\ge 0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFind the function $h(x).$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424886 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "2b70eaac-0c45-5da5-8a2f-2002d9071035" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424886 #edb/ref 1074 "Since our random variable $X$ has a probability distribution function $f(x)$ that involves an absolute value, the cumulative distribution function takes the following form:\n\n$$\nF(x)=P(X\\le x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{x}\\frac{{e}^{t/3}}{6}\\,\\text{d}t, & x<0 \\\\ {\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}\\frac{{e}^{t/3}}{6}\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{0}^{x}\\frac{{e}^{-t/3}}{6}\\,\\text{d}t, & x\\ge 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's compute the integrals.\n\n- If $x\\le 0,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{x}\\frac{{e}^{t/3}}{6}\\,\\text{d}t & ={\\frac{{e}^{t/3}}{2}|}_{-\\infty }^{x} \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{x/3}}{2},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}\\frac{{e}^{t/3}}{6}\\,\\text{d}t & ={\\frac{{e}^{x/3}}{2}|}_{x=0} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- If $x>0,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{x}\\frac{{e}^{-t/3}}{6}\\,\\text{d}t & =-{\\frac{{e}^{-t/3}}{2}|}_{0}^{x} \\\\  & =-\\frac{{e}^{-x/3}}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs a result, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}\\frac{{e}^{-t/3}}{6}\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{0}^{x}\\frac{{e}^{-t/3}}{6}\\,\\text{d}t & =\\frac{1}{2}+(-\\frac{{e}^{-x/3}}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}) \\\\  & =1-\\frac{{e}^{-x/3}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the cumulative distribution function is given by\n\n$$\nF(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{e}^{x/3}}{2}, & x<0 \\\\ 1-\\frac{{e}^{-x/3}}{2}, & x\\ge 0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424889 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186424890 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424889 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "3f2429d9-8a43-540c-8ee1-21b8c07473a4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424889 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186424886 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424890 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "9bf4404a-eca3-5f58-9aa8-59a46fdb29aa" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424890 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186424888 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424891 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186424889 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424891 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "b81f8974-1a7b-53cb-bb5f-1b47021e293e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424891 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186424887 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442302 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186442326 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442302 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186442327 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442302 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186442328 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442302 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186442329 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442302 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186442330 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442302 #edb/ref 1044 #edb/ref 17592186045464 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442302 #edb/ref 1045 "Cumulative Distribution Func